# CampusEcho Environment Variables Configuration

# To connect your remote Supabase PostgreSQL project:
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the migration SQL located in /supabase/migrations/01_init.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor
# 3. Copy your project URL and anon public key below and save as .env

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here
